## Comparison with Other MCP Servers

| Feature | Scrapling MCP | Playwright MCP | Scrapling Official MCP |
|---------|---------------|----------------|------------------------|
| HTTP fetching | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Dynamic browser | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Anti-bot bypass | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ |
| CSS pre-filtering | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Browser interaction | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Screenshots | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| JavaScript evaluation | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Bulk operations | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Adaptive tracking | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Total tools | 31 | ~50 | 10 |

